  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc18:2.3.7": "Sp 2.133: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tasmiṁ ṭhitoti āhaccapādake mañce vā pīṭhe vā ṭhito upari nāgadantakādīsu laggitakaṁ cīvaraṁ vā kiñci vā gaṇhāti vā, aññaṁ vā laggeti, tassāpi anāpatti</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tasmiṁ ṭhito</i>: standing on the bed or bench with detachable legs, he takes hold of a robe or anything else hanging from a wall peg, etc., above, or he puts something up; for this too there is no offense.” ",
